<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  오버나잇 스케줄러 (라이브, 실주문) launchd 에이전트 — WOO-98 / O2. 실제 자금이 집행된다.
  설치: cp deploy/launchd/com.autocoin.overnight.live.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
        launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.autocoin.overnight.live.plist
  중지: launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/com.autocoin.overnight.live
  상태: .venv/bin/python -m src.overnight.runner --status

  - 수집기(com.autocoin.collector)가 DB 에 넣는 호가·체결를 B안 호가·건강 검사에 쓴다 (체결은 거래소). 수집기가 먼저 떠 있어야 한다
  - 종료되면 60초 후 재시작. 재시작하면 data/overnight_live/live/ 상태 파일로 이어간다
  - 킬 스위치: touch data/overnight_live/live/KILL
  - 등록은 사용자가 직접 한다. 멈출 땐 킬 스위치 → bootout 순서 (포지션은 스케줄러가 정리)
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.autocoin.overnight.live</string>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/Users/woojin/Desktop/autocoin/.venv/bin/python</string>
        <string>-m</string>
        <string>src.overnight.runner</string>
        <string>--mode</string>
        <string>live</string>
        <string>--confirm-live</string>
    </array>
    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/woojin/Desktop/autocoin</string>
    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>OBSIDIAN_AUTOJI_PATH</key>
        <string>/Users/woojin/Library/Mobile Documents/iCloud~md~obsidian/Documents/autoji</string>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql@18/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
        <key>PYTHONUNBUFFERED</key>
        <string>1</string>
    </dict>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <true/>
    <key>ThrottleInterval</key>
    <integer>60</integer>
    <key>ProcessType</key>
    <string>Standard</string>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/woojin/Desktop/autocoin/logs/overnight.live.out.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/woojin/Desktop/autocoin/logs/overnight.live.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
